WEBVTT

00:05.720 --> 00:09.180
<b>Oh! We're back!</b>

00:13.310 --> 00:17.860
<b>I wonder if the preparation for
the foundation festival is going okay?</b>

00:17.860 --> 00:18.900
<b>Ryoma.</b>

00:18.900 --> 00:20.110
<b>Yes?</b>

00:20.110 --> 00:22.360
<b>You must be worried about your shop.</b>

00:22.360 --> 00:27.740
<b>We can take care of reporting to the guild.
You can go ahead and head home.</b>

00:27.740 --> 00:31.290
<b>Oh, no. I'll go with you.</b>

00:31.290 --> 00:34.540
<b>My Dimension Home has
all the treant wood, too.</b>

00:34.540 --> 00:39.380
<b>You can transfer the wood
to my Dimension Home.</b>

00:39.380 --> 00:40.840
<b>Mr. Leipin.</b>

00:40.840 --> 00:43.180
<b>You two are so considerate!</b>

00:43.180 --> 00:46.550
<b>Ryoma, you should take them up on it!</b>

00:46.550 --> 00:49.140
<b>Thank you. In that case...</b>

00:49.140 --> 00:52.940
<b>Mr. Leipin, Mr. Asagi, thank you.</b>

00:52.940 --> 00:55.190
<b>This is nothing.</b>

00:55.190 --> 01:00.400
<b>You shared some miso and soy sauce with me,
and taught me where to buy them, too.</b>

01:09.950 --> 01:12.790
<b>Thanks, everyone. Good work!</b>

01:12.790 --> 01:17.750
<b>See you soon, Ryoma!
I'll visit you at the festival for sure!</b>

01:17.750 --> 01:20.250
<b>Yes, we'll be waiting!</b>

01:36.310 --> 01:39.110
<b>Wow, the stall is up already.</b>

01:39.110 --> 01:40.770
<b>Welcome back, Manager.</b>

01:40.770 --> 01:43.940
<b>I'm back. Hmm?</b>

01:45.780 --> 01:46.820
<b>Huh?</b>

01:46.820 --> 01:48.820
<b>What?!</b>

03:19.960 --> 03:24.960
<b>"Episode 11"
"Ryoma and the Busy Days"</b>

03:27.050 --> 03:29.340
<b>Hey, Ryoma, you impressed?</b>

03:29.340 --> 03:32.390
<b>It's not your achievement alone.</b>

03:32.390 --> 03:35.680
<b>Mr. Dolce, that...</b>

03:35.680 --> 03:38.430
<b>Yes. I was surprised, as well.</b>

03:38.430 --> 03:43.020
<b>The Semroid Troupe has many workers
skilled in that type of labor.</b>

03:43.020 --> 03:45.070
<b>They built that in just two days.</b>

03:45.070 --> 03:46.610
<b>Two days?!</b>

03:46.610 --> 03:51.030
<b>Yes. It was like magic.</b>

03:52.200 --> 03:54.740
<b>Traveling entertainers are awesome.</b>

03:54.740 --> 03:56.870
<b>Not just the stage.</b>

03:58.120 --> 04:01.370
<b>They helped us build our stall as well.</b>

04:01.370 --> 04:03.920
<b>Huh? Our stall, too?</b>

04:03.920 --> 04:05.710
<b>Of course!</b>

04:05.710 --> 04:07.170
<b>Whoa!</b>

04:07.170 --> 04:13.090
<b>Enjoying your delicious cooking
and watching our show.</b>

04:13.090 --> 04:19.140
<b>That will undoubtedly be a wonderful
experience for those who visit us!</b>

04:19.140 --> 04:22.980
<b>Then obviously it makes sense
for us to help!</b>

04:22.980 --> 04:26.400
<b>We are comrades after all.</b>

04:27.230 --> 04:29.400
<b>Mr. Prenance.</b>

04:29.400 --> 04:32.030
<b>Come now,
only the finishing touches remain!</b>

04:32.030 --> 04:36.620
<b>We shall achieve beauty
fit for this wonderful festival!</b>

04:36.620 --> 04:38.240
<b>Yeah!</b>

04:38.240 --> 04:39.660
<b>What's going on?</b>

04:39.660 --> 04:43.170
<b>Oh, Manager, you're back.</b>

04:43.170 --> 04:47.920
<b>Mr. Callum! I'm so surprised
things are moving along so quickly!</b>

04:49.420 --> 04:50.590
<b>Manager.</b>

04:50.590 --> 04:51.760
<b>Yes?</b>

04:51.760 --> 04:55.550
<b>There's something I wanted to
discuss with you concerning that.</b>

04:55.550 --> 04:56.680
<b>Huh...?</b>

04:56.680 --> 04:58.470
<b>About drinks?</b>

04:58.470 --> 04:59.430
<b>Yes.</b>

04:59.430 --> 05:03.560
<b>While Mr. Dolce and the others
were building the stall itself,</b>

05:03.560 --> 05:07.440
<b>we were trying to figure out the menu.</b>

05:07.440 --> 05:12.570
<b>We decided on the food pretty quickly,
but we're still thinking about the drinks.</b>

05:12.570 --> 05:13.570
<b>I'm sorry...</b>

05:13.570 --> 05:17.120
<b>Um, can you explain, Mr. Callum?</b>

05:17.120 --> 05:21.160
<b>Yes. For food, we have Gilmar
cuisine and unique dishes</b>

05:21.160 --> 05:26.170
<b>based on dante seeds and semesa pastries.</b>

05:26.170 --> 05:29.500
<b>But for drinks...</b>

05:29.500 --> 05:33.220
<b>We only have ordinary things,
like water and juices.</b>

05:33.220 --> 05:39.760
<b>Miss Li Ling suggested that perhaps there
should be something unique here, as well.</b>

05:39.760 --> 05:41.060
<b>I see.</b>

05:41.060 --> 05:45.640
<b>I'm sorry. It was almost all settled,
but I mixed it up unnecessarily.</b>

05:45.640 --> 05:49.810
<b>No, your opinion is very valuable.</b>

05:49.810 --> 05:56.610
<b>So we were thinking, perhaps we could add
the dante tea you sometimes drink to the menu.</b>

05:56.610 --> 05:58.070
<b>What do you think?</b>

05:58.070 --> 06:00.330
<b>Oh, that...</b>

06:00.330 --> 06:04.790
<b>I'm sorry, that one is
completely personal.</b>

06:04.790 --> 06:09.540
<b>It's hard to make enough to offer
at a stall, with so little time left.</b>

06:09.540 --> 06:13.170
<b>I see. It's quite rare,</b>

06:13.170 --> 06:16.630
<b>so I thought it would be a good fit.</b>

06:18.260 --> 06:24.850
<b>A tea that we don't see here...</b>

06:24.850 --> 06:26.770
<b>I wonder...</b>

06:33.360 --> 06:34.570
<b>Oh!</b>

06:39.570 --> 06:42.280
<b>Manager, what is this...?</b>

06:42.280 --> 06:43.450
<b>Barley tea.</b>

06:43.450 --> 06:49.620
<b>I remembered we got some grains
from Miss Jane's hometown earlier.</b>

06:49.620 --> 06:53.250
<b>Huh? You can make tea out of grains?</b>

06:53.250 --> 06:56.670
<b>Yes. The grains are roasted
and boiled to make the tea.</b>

06:56.670 --> 07:00.720
<b>It has healthy properties
similar to dante tea.</b>

07:00.720 --> 07:05.720
<b>It's also great for hot summers.
Please give it a try.</b>

07:15.980 --> 07:18.150
<b>I've never had tea like this before!</b>

07:18.150 --> 07:20.780
<b>It's so savory, even though it's tea!</b>

07:20.780 --> 07:24.280
<b>It should fit the food well, too,
served cold!</b>

07:24.280 --> 07:29.910
<b>We have the ingredients already,
and it's not hard to make.</b>

07:29.910 --> 07:32.670
<b>How about we add this to the menu?</b>

07:32.670 --> 07:37.840
<b>Everyone's response is... Positive.</b>

07:37.840 --> 07:40.470
<b>Thank you, Manager.</b>

07:40.470 --> 07:45.100
<b>Let's add this tea to the menu
and call it complete.</b>

07:45.100 --> 07:51.810
<b>Yes! Now the only work remaining
is polish and production.</b>

07:51.810 --> 07:56.150
<b>Preparation is in its final stages.
Let's do our best, everyone!</b>

07:56.150 --> 07:57.690
<b>Yes!</b>

08:07.700 --> 08:09.580
<b>Manager!</b>

08:09.580 --> 08:11.500
<b>Yes!</b>

08:15.380 --> 08:16.840
<b>Mr. Ryoma.</b>

08:16.840 --> 08:18.250
<b>Yes.</b>

08:21.010 --> 08:23.090
<b>An ice sculpture?</b>

08:23.090 --> 08:27.510
<b>Yes! I had a great idea for a show.</b>

08:27.510 --> 08:31.940
<b>I have been told
you are quite the sculptor.</b>

08:31.940 --> 08:35.690
<b>Could you lend your skills?</b>

08:35.690 --> 08:39.570
<b>Yes, gladly! So what kind of thing should I--</b>

08:39.570 --> 08:42.570
<b>Oh, there you are.</b>

08:42.570 --> 08:44.490
<b>Mr. Serge.</b>

08:44.490 --> 08:46.490
<b>Is something wrong?</b>

08:46.490 --> 08:50.700
<b>There's something I'd like
the both of you to see.</b>

08:53.370 --> 08:54.460
<b>Is this...?</b>

08:54.460 --> 08:58.340
<b>Yes, this is the music box
to sell at the festival.</b>

08:58.340 --> 09:01.210
<b>The delivery from Mr. Dinome just arrived.</b>

09:01.210 --> 09:07.760
<b>Oh! So our troupe's music is
in this box! How wonderful!</b>

09:12.020 --> 09:14.190
<b>Mr. Ryoma?</b>

09:14.190 --> 09:15.520
<b>Oh, sorry.</b>

09:15.520 --> 09:18.900
<b>Mr. Serge, can we take a listen?</b>

09:18.900 --> 09:21.900
<b>Yes, of course.</b>

09:48.140 --> 09:49.600
<b>Wow!</b>

09:49.600 --> 09:53.310
<b>Who would have thought something
so wonderful could be built?!</b>

09:55.140 --> 09:58.100
<b>Yes, I'm surprised, as well.</b>

09:58.100 --> 10:02.150
<b>What a glamorous display!</b>

10:02.150 --> 10:04.900
<b>We must redouble our efforts.</b>

10:04.900 --> 10:09.280
<b>We must display the best
performance of our careers!</b>

10:09.280 --> 10:11.030
<b>Yes!</b>

10:11.030 --> 10:13.830
<b>That's great to hear.</b>

10:13.830 --> 10:16.460
<b>I'm glad we worked so hard on this!</b>

10:16.460 --> 10:21.000
<b>Yes. I can't wait to have
the festival start in two days.</b>

10:21.000 --> 10:22.840
<b>Yes.</b>

10:26.170 --> 10:29.430
<b>Sorry, I lost focus there for a moment.</b>

10:29.430 --> 10:33.970
<b>It's only natural. Hunting treants,
preparing for the festival...</b>

10:33.970 --> 10:37.190
<b>You've been very busy for a while now.</b>

10:37.190 --> 10:42.190
<b>Manager, you can leave the rest to us.
Please take the day off tomorrow.</b>

10:42.190 --> 10:47.700
<b>What? Just me? But all of you
have been busy, too.</b>

10:48.570 --> 10:53.950
<b>Manager, we need your help
on the day of the festival.</b>

10:53.950 --> 10:57.410
<b>Please rest tomorrow
to recoup your energy.</b>

10:58.670 --> 11:00.420
<b>Mr. Ryoma.</b>

11:02.880 --> 11:07.220
<b>I understand.
I'll take the day off tomorrow.</b>

11:07.220 --> 11:11.930
<b>Everyone! Great work!</b>

11:11.930 --> 11:15.220
<b>Dinner is ready!</b>

11:25.360 --> 11:30.030
<b>Wow! So this is what
a high multiplication skill can do!</b>

11:46.050 --> 11:48.920
<b>Hmm? Is that...</b>

11:48.920 --> 11:51.720
<b>...from the Dragoon's Guild in Lenaf?</b>

11:57.270 --> 11:59.350
<b>And Mr. Pioro?!</b>

12:04.940 --> 12:08.110
<b>--Not fat yet. Can eat more! Shut up!
--My marvelous performance
will shine a light on you all!</b>

12:08.110 --> 12:09.900
<b>--No you can't.
--Not fat yet. Can eat more! Shut up!
--My marvelous performance
will shine a light on you all!</b>

12:10.570 --> 12:15.450
<b>Lefty Callum, Righty Carla. Got it?</b>

12:21.830 --> 12:23.420
<b>I knew it.</b>

12:24.540 --> 12:27.050
<b>Mr. Pioro!</b>

12:27.050 --> 12:32.300
<b>Oh, hey, Ryoma! It's been a short while.</b>

12:34.590 --> 12:35.680
<b>Yes.</b>

12:35.680 --> 12:40.020
<b>But what are you doing here?
Taking a walk?</b>

12:40.930 --> 12:43.850
<b>I saw a monster from the Dragoon's Guild,</b>

12:43.850 --> 12:46.730
<b>and you riding it, so...</b>

12:46.730 --> 12:50.740
<b>You really have good eyesight!
So that's why you came out here.</b>

12:50.740 --> 12:53.150
<b>What about your shop, though?</b>

12:53.150 --> 12:57.620
<b>You're doing a stall for the Foundation
Festival, right? Carla told me.</b>

12:57.620 --> 13:01.160
<b>Yes, we finished
setting that up yesterday.</b>

13:01.160 --> 13:03.790
<b>I'm taking the day off today.</b>

13:03.790 --> 13:07.290
<b>By the way, why are you here, Mr. Pioro?</b>

13:07.290 --> 13:13.880
<b>I got a rush order. They wanted it
delivered today, no matter what.</b>

13:13.880 --> 13:15.300
<b>Today, no matter what?</b>

13:15.300 --> 13:19.680
<b>Yep. Probably something
to do with the festival.</b>

13:19.680 --> 13:23.140
<b>That said, they ordered
some pretty rare stuff.</b>

13:23.140 --> 13:25.600
<b>I got curious about
what they're using it for.</b>

13:25.600 --> 13:28.060
<b>So you came all the way out here?</b>

13:28.060 --> 13:32.110
<b>Yep. I was going to
visit the festival anyway,</b>

13:32.110 --> 13:35.660
<b>so I thought, "Oh, what the heck?
Might as well tag along."</b>

13:35.660 --> 13:39.080
<b>Hmm? Ryoma?</b>

13:39.080 --> 13:40.120
<b>Huh?</b>

13:40.120 --> 13:41.950
<b>Mr. Asagi?</b>

13:43.370 --> 13:45.040
<b>What, you two know each other?</b>

13:45.040 --> 13:49.920
<b>Yes, he's a senior adventurer,
and we just did a job together...</b>

13:50.670 --> 13:54.340
<b>Wait, so is this...?!</b>

13:54.340 --> 13:57.340
<b>Yes. It's miso, soy sauce, and white rice!</b>

13:57.340 --> 14:00.050
<b>Foods from the Dragonewt village.</b>

14:00.050 --> 14:04.810
<b>I knew the quality was good,
so I ordered them right away!</b>

14:04.810 --> 14:10.230
<b>So I guess Ryoma did
some advertisement for us?</b>

14:10.230 --> 14:15.190
<b>Seems like I did. Though I didn't
expect you to order so suddenly...</b>

14:16.110 --> 14:20.870
<b>Mr. Asagi, did you use up
the share I gave you already?</b>

14:20.870 --> 14:24.370
<b>Well, actually, some things happened.</b>

14:24.370 --> 14:25.710
<b>Things?</b>

14:25.710 --> 14:30.750
<b>I'd love to explain,
but I must return quickly. I'm sorry.</b>

14:31.840 --> 14:34.170
<b>Please, follow me.</b>

14:34.170 --> 14:35.590
<b>Ryoma!</b>

14:35.590 --> 14:36.840
<b>Whoa!</b>

14:40.180 --> 14:46.560
<b>Miya, give Ryoma a break. He's confused.</b>

14:48.520 --> 14:52.190
<b>Hmm? Why is Ryoma here anyway?</b>

14:52.190 --> 14:55.650
<b>And who's the other gentleman?</b>

14:55.650 --> 14:58.150
<b>Took you long enough to notice.</b>

14:58.150 --> 15:04.200
<b>This is Mr. Pioro. He came to
deliver the food from Lenaf.</b>

15:04.200 --> 15:05.790
<b>Ryoma is...</b>

15:05.790 --> 15:10.330
<b>I just happened to be there
when Mr. Asagi received the package.</b>

15:11.210 --> 15:16.130
<b>Um, Miss Miya, you're building a stall,
which means...</b>

15:16.130 --> 15:20.130
<b>Great of you to notice, Ryoma!</b>

15:20.130 --> 15:26.970
<b>It's as you assume. Miya and I are going to
run a stall at the Foundation Festival.</b>

15:26.970 --> 15:30.100
<b>Um, why you two...?</b>

15:31.400 --> 15:36.400
<b>Asagi! Please! Make that thing
from the other day!</b>

15:36.400 --> 15:39.280
<b>What thing do you mean?</b>

15:39.280 --> 15:44.330
<b>That crunchy thing Ryoma made
after we beat the treants!</b>

15:44.330 --> 15:47.580
<b>The one you were crying over!</b>

15:47.580 --> 15:50.750
<b>Oh, tempura. Right.</b>

15:50.750 --> 15:56.710
<b>That's it! I want that again!
Make it, please!</b>

15:56.710 --> 16:02.930
<b>I don't mind, but... Why me?
Why not ask Ryoma?</b>

16:02.930 --> 16:09.480
<b>I went to see him, but he seemed
so busy preparing for the festival.</b>

16:09.480 --> 16:11.980
<b>I felt bad to bother him.</b>

16:13.900 --> 16:18.480
<b>I see. So that's why
you came to me instead.</b>

16:18.480 --> 16:22.320
<b>Indeed! I thought you'd have
nothing better to do!</b>

16:22.320 --> 16:27.330
<b>Nothing better... Well, fine.</b>

16:27.330 --> 16:31.370
<b>I was going to cook something anyway.</b>

16:33.170 --> 16:34.630
<b>Yay!</b>

16:34.630 --> 16:39.010
<b>I don't have any mountain vegetables on hand,
so I fried up some regular vegetables.</b>

16:39.010 --> 16:42.970
<b>And I also prepared some
white rice and miso soup.</b>

16:42.970 --> 16:45.760
<b>Thanks, Asagi!</b>

16:53.440 --> 16:57.520
<b>How is it? I employed some
secret techniques from my village</b>

16:57.520 --> 17:00.940
<b>to prepare the vegetables.
The flavor of the--</b>

17:00.940 --> 17:03.910
<b>Delicious!</b>

17:03.910 --> 17:06.120
<b>It's too delicious!</b>

17:06.120 --> 17:08.370
<b>The mountain veggies from
the other day were awesome,</b>

17:08.370 --> 17:12.370
<b>but so, too, are these regular veggies...</b>

17:12.370 --> 17:16.210
<b>I can't believe it...
How is this even possible...?</b>

17:16.210 --> 17:17.040
<b>Asagi!</b>

17:17.040 --> 17:19.630
<b>Wh-What is it?</b>

17:19.630 --> 17:24.340
<b>The world must know about
this delicious thing!</b>

17:24.340 --> 17:26.800
<b>We have to sell this
at the Foundation Festival!</b>

17:26.800 --> 17:28.550
<b>Y-Yes.</b>

17:28.550 --> 17:29.810
<b>Wait, what?!</b>

17:30.600 --> 17:32.270
<b>And that's how it went.</b>

17:32.270 --> 17:36.060
<b>If we sell vegetable tempura,
it will make everyone happy!</b>

17:36.060 --> 17:39.650
<b>As members of this town,
we will fire up this festival!</b>

17:39.650 --> 17:42.280
<b>I see... So that's why.</b>

17:47.490 --> 17:52.660
<b>The young lady is right, though.
This is super good.</b>

17:52.660 --> 17:54.210
<b>Try a bite, Ryoma.</b>

17:54.210 --> 17:56.290
<b>Right. In that case...</b>

18:00.250 --> 18:03.380
<b>Wow! So delicious, Mr. Asagi!</b>

18:03.380 --> 18:08.430
<b>The breading is perfect, and the flavor
of the vegetables is so pronounced!</b>

18:09.640 --> 18:14.480
<b>Yes, after decided to sell these
at the festival, I practiced many times.</b>

18:14.480 --> 18:17.230
<b>Perhaps my craft has improved.</b>

18:17.230 --> 18:21.730
<b>This will definitely sell!
I look forward to your tempura stand--</b>

18:23.780 --> 18:26.360
<b>Ryoma, you underestimate us.</b>

18:26.360 --> 18:27.490
<b>Huh?</b>

18:27.490 --> 18:30.950
<b>Ryoma, we're not just selling tempura.</b>

18:30.950 --> 18:34.660
<b>We plan to sell white rice
and miso soup, as well.</b>

18:34.660 --> 18:40.080
<b>White rice and miso soup?!
Seriously? At a festival? Usually--</b>

18:40.080 --> 18:46.510
<b>Yes, people prefer eating
while walking. I am aware, but...</b>

18:46.510 --> 18:51.510
<b>Tempura is more delicious
with rice and miso soup!</b>

18:51.510 --> 18:53.560
<b>When she puts it that way, well...</b>

18:53.560 --> 18:57.230
<b>We started this as a way to allow the people
of this town to enjoy something delicious.</b>

18:57.230 --> 19:03.230
<b>Compromising on the taste to match
other expectations does not fit my style!</b>

19:10.200 --> 19:13.910
<b>Mr. Asagi, then how about
something like this?</b>

19:17.370 --> 19:20.330
<b>Wow! This is cute!</b>

19:20.330 --> 19:22.790
<b>I see. Interesting idea.</b>

19:22.790 --> 19:24.340
<b>Ryoma, what is this?</b>

19:24.340 --> 19:29.130
<b>This is "tenmusu."
This way, you can eat while walking.</b>

19:29.130 --> 19:33.720
<b>I didn't think of putting anything inside
a rice ball other than pickled plums...</b>

19:33.720 --> 19:36.470
<b>Nice. This will sell!</b>

19:36.470 --> 19:38.980
<b>Thanks, Ryoma!</b>

19:41.650 --> 19:43.110
<b>Delicious!</b>

19:43.110 --> 19:44.900
<b>Ryoma, you have my thanks.</b>

19:44.900 --> 19:48.940
<b>Please, don't mention it.
Let's make this a great festival.</b>

19:48.940 --> 19:50.150
<b>Yes!</b>

19:52.160 --> 19:55.240
<b>Ryoma! Thanks for today!</b>

19:55.240 --> 19:58.200
<b>I'll make sure to visit
your stall at the festival, too,</b>

19:58.200 --> 20:00.580
<b>so please come by ours, as well!</b>

20:00.580 --> 20:02.380
<b>Yes!</b>

20:04.960 --> 20:10.090
<b>Tenmusu, huh? That was a good experience.</b>

20:10.090 --> 20:12.720
<b>Would you mind if I
sold that at my store, too?</b>

20:12.720 --> 20:17.560
<b>No, of course not. Fried meats and fish
go well in that, as well.</b>

20:17.560 --> 20:24.110
<b>Oh, that sounds nice! I'll give it a try
once I get back to Lenaf.</b>

20:24.110 --> 20:29.320
<b>See you around, Ryoma. I'll stop by
your place and say hi tomorrow.</b>

20:29.320 --> 20:31.530
<b>Yes, we'll be waiting.</b>

20:31.530 --> 20:35.320
<b>We have some interesting dishes ready,
so please come by.</b>

20:35.320 --> 20:40.290
<b>Oh, that sounds nice! See ya.</b>

20:40.290 --> 20:41.660
<b>Yes!</b>

20:50.970 --> 20:53.470
<b>So how's Ryoma doing?</b>

20:53.470 --> 20:56.970
<b>He's doing well. Look.</b>

20:56.970 --> 21:00.730
<b>Cool, he seems to be having fun.</b>

21:00.730 --> 21:01.930
<b>Yes.</b>

21:01.930 --> 21:04.690
<b>You seem quite upbeat, Kufo.</b>

21:04.690 --> 21:10.530
<b>What a rare sight, seeing you outside
of your own realm, Fernobelia.</b>

21:10.530 --> 21:13.740
<b>There might be a chance that
the slime research Ryoma is doing</b>

21:13.740 --> 21:19.620
<b>could lead to good effects on
the magical properties of this world.</b>

21:19.620 --> 21:21.160
<b>Ah.</b>

21:21.160 --> 21:24.580
<b>Is your reason for being
upbeat also Ryoma?</b>

21:24.580 --> 21:27.750
<b>Yes, since he seems to be having fun.</b>

21:27.750 --> 21:29.960
<b>And that makes you happy, too?</b>

21:29.960 --> 21:32.090
<b>Of course.</b>

21:32.090 --> 21:36.260
<b>Seeing a person we invited
to this world living so happily...</b>

21:36.260 --> 21:38.680
<b>Of course that makes me happy.</b>

21:40.470 --> 21:42.220
<b>I see.</b>

21:44.310 --> 21:51.320
<b>Enjoy your life to the fullest
in our world, Ryoma.</b>

21:56.410 --> 21:59.330
<b>Everyone, let's do our best tomorrow!</b>

21:59.330 --> 22:01.490
<b>Yeah!</b>

22:01.490 --> 22:02.700
<b>Elia,</b>

22:02.700 --> 22:07.170
<b>the festival is finally starting!</b>
